 (in)"' /><member value='"Feels-like temp (F)"' /><member value='"Cloud cover (%)"' /></members></column></datasource-dependencies><zones><zone h='100000' id='2' type='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'><zone h='10370' w='66667' x='0' y='0' id='3' type='text'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#FFFFFF' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='26'>WHO SHOWS UP ON HALLOWEEN?</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run fontcolor='#F6D7B0' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>How weather and darkness shape the trick-or-treat rush — 2008–2025 · One porch in Cincinnati, OH 45207</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='margin' value='14' /><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='background-color' value='#2B1D3F' /></zone-style></zone><zone h='8704' w='32292' x='67188' y='926' id='4' type='text'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#F2B33D' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='9'>HOW TO USE</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run fontcolor='#FFFFFF' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='9'>• Click a year (bar, dot or heat-map row) to highlight it across year-based charts. Click blank space to clear.</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run fontcolor='#FFFFFF' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='9'>• Use the three controls below to add 2020 back in, recolour the years, or swap the weather on the x-axis.</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run fontcolor='#FFFFFF' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='9'>• Hover over marks for values and weather details.</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='margin' value='6' /><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='background-color' value='#2B1D3F' /></zone-style></zone><zone h='10185' w='16927' x='833' y='11296' id='5' name="KPI Kids per Night" show-title='false'><zone-style><format attr='margin' value='6' /><format attr='border-color' value='#E6DED3' /><format attr='border-style' value='solid' /><format attr='border-width' value='1' /><format attr='background-color' value='#FFFFFF' /></zone-style></zone><zone h='10185' w='16927' x='18177' y='11296' id='6' name="KPI Peak Hour" show-title='false'><zone-style><format attr='margin' value='6' /><format attr='border-color' value='#E6DED3' /><format attr='border-style' value='solid' /><format attr='border-width' value='1' /><format attr='background-color' value='#FFFFFF' /></zone-style></zone><zone h='10185' w='16927' x='35521' y='11296' id='7' name="KPI Rain Effect" show-title='false'><zone-style><format attr='margin' value='6' /><format attr='border-color' value='#E6DED3' /><format attr='border-style' value='solid' /><format attr='border-width' value='1' /><format attr='background-color' value='#FFFFFF' /></zone-style></zone><zone h='10185' w='16927' x='52865' y='11296' id='8' name="KPI Arrival Time" show-title='false'><zone-style><format attr='margin' value='6' /><format attr='border-color' value='#E6DED3' /><format attr='border-style' value='solid' /><format attr='border-width' value='1' /><format attr='background-color' value='#FFFFFF' /></zone-style></zone><zone h='2407' w='28854' x='70312' y='11111' id='9' type='text'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#E8590C' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='9'>CONTROLS</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='margin' value='4' /><format attr='border-style' value='none' /></zone-style></zone><zone h='5370' w='9375' x='70312' y='13519' id='10' mode='compact' param='[Parameters].[Parameter 1]' type='paramctrl'><zone-style><format attr='margin' value='4' /><format attr='border-style' value='none' /></zone-style></zone><zone h='5370' w='9375' x='80052' y='13519' id='11' mode='compact' param='[Parameters].[Parameter 2]' type='paramctrl'><zone-style><format attr='margin' value='4' /><format attr='border-style' value='none' /></zone-style></zone><zone h='5370' w='9375' x='89792' y='13519' id='12' mode='compact' param='[Parameters].[Parameter 3]' type='paramctrl'><zone-style><format attr='margin' value='4' /><format attr='border-style' value='none' /></zone-style></zone><zone h='2778' w='28854' x='70312' y='18889' id='13' type='text'><formatted-text><run italic='true' fontcolor='#6E6875' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='8'>2020 is excluded by default — the COVID candy-chute year is an outlier, not a weather effect.</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='margin' value='4' /><format attr='border-style' value='none' /></zone-style></zone><zone h='35185' w='46875' x='833' y='22407' id='14' name="Year by Year"><zone-style><format attr='margin' value='6' /><format attr='border-color' value='#E6DED3' /><format attr='border-style' value='solid' /><format attr='border-width' value='1' /><format attr='background-color' value='#FFFFFF' /></zone-style></zone><zone h='13889' w='10208' x='48021' y='23333' id='15' name="Year by Year" param="[federated.0hw2026trickortreatweather01].[none:Calculation_ColorBy:nk]" type='color'><zone-style><format attr='margin' value='4' /><format attr='border-style' value='none' /></zone-style></zone><zone h='25370' w='10208' x='48021' y='31296' id='16' type='text'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#E8590C' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='9'>WHAT STANDS OUT</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run fontcolor='#2E2A33' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>Rain and wind align with smaller crowds.</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run fontcolor='#2E2A33' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>2013: 391 kids, rain + 47 mph gusts.</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run fontcolor='#2E2A33' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>2017: 776 kids, 36°F feels-like.</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run fontcolor='#2E2A33' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>Weekend nights: 595 kids vs. 632 on school nights (5 vs. 12 years; excludes 2020).</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='margin' value='8' /><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='background-color' value='#FFFFFF' /></zone-style></zone><zone h='35185' w='40521' x='58646' y='22407' id='17' name="Arrival Curve"><zone-style><format attr='margin' value='6' /><format attr='border-color' value='#E6DED3' /><format attr='border-style' value='solid' /><format attr='border-width' value='1' /><format attr='background-color' value='#FFFFFF' /></zone-style></zone><zone h='32963' w='31250' x='833' y='58333' id='18' name="Rush Hour Heatmap"><zone-style><format attr='margin' value='6' /><format attr='border-color' value='#E6DED3' /><format attr='border-style' value='solid' /><format attr='border-width' value='1' /><format attr='background-color' value='#FFFFFF' /></zone-style></zone><zone h='32963' w='34375' x='32500' y='58333' id='19' name="Weather Explorer"><zone-style><format attr='margin' value='6' /><format attr='border-color' value='#E6DED3' /><format attr='border-style' value='solid' /><format attr='border-width' value='1' /><format attr='background-color' value='#FFFFFF' /></zone-style></zone><zone h='32963' w='31875' x='67292' y='58333' id='20' name="Arrival Time Trend"><zone-style><format attr='margin' value='6' /><format attr='border-color' value='#E6DED3' /><format attr='border-style' value='solid' /><format attr='border-width' value='1' /><format attr='background-color' value='#FFFFFF' /></zone-style></zone><zone h='5185' w='10417' x='21250' y='58889' id='21' name="Rush Hour Heatmap" param="[federated.0hw2026trickortreatweather01].[sum:Count:qk]" type='color'><zone-style><format attr='margin' value='4' /><format attr='border-style' value='none' /></zone-style></zone><zone h='7963' w='100000' x='0' y='92037' id='22' type='text'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#2E2A33' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='9'>SOURCES  </run><run fontcolor='#6E6875' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='9'>Counts: Jeffrey Shaffer, HalloweenTableau2025.xlsx. Weather: Open-Meteo Historical Weather API / ERA5 (ECMWF/Copernicus), open-meteo.com/en/docs/historical-weather-api. Sun position: NOAA Global Monitoring Laboratory, General Solar Position Calculations.</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#2E2A33' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='9'>METHOD  </run><run fontcolor='#6E6875' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='9'>Weather timestamps corrected to EDT; rain = ≥ 0.01 in from 6–8 pm. Counts cover the window ending at the logged time; final window = 15 min. Arrival times are estimated from window midpoints. Repeated night-level fields use AVG/ATTR. Small sample: associations, not causation. </run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#5B3F8C' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='9'>Individual class project</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='margin' value='6' /><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='background-color' value='#F1EBE2' /></zone-style></zone></zone></zones><simple-id uuid="{F89F4F22-8A90-5CA9-9256-04101AC163C9}" /></dashboard></dashboards><windows source-height='30'><window class='worksheet' name="KPI Kids per Night"><cards><edge name='left'><strip size='160'><card type='pages' /><card type='filters' /><card type='marks' /></strip></edge><edge name='top'><strip size='2147483647'><card type='columns' /></strip><strip size='2147483647'><card type='rows' /></strip><strip size='31'><card type='title' /></strip></edge></cards></window><window class='worksheet' name="KPI Peak Hour"><cards><edge name='left'><strip size='160'><card type='pages' /><card type='filters' /><card type='marks' /></strip></edge><edge name='top'><strip size='2147483647'><card type='columns' /></strip><strip size='2147483647'><card type='rows' /></strip><strip size='31'><card type='title' /></strip></edge></cards></window><window class='worksheet' name="KPI Rain Effect"><cards><edge name='left'><strip size='160'><card type='pages' /><card type='filters' /><card type='marks' /></strip></edge><edge name='top'><strip size='2147483647'><card type='columns' /></strip><strip size='2147483647'><card type='rows' /></strip><strip size='31'><card type='title' /></strip></edge></cards></window><window class='worksheet' name="KPI Arrival Time"><cards><edge name='left'><strip size='160'><card type='page